<title>USA: Area Bancshares sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Area Bancshares sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>OWENSBORO, Ky. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Area Bancshares Corp said on Tuesday that it has declared a three-for-two stock split in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The number of shares outstanding will increase to 11.4 million from 7.6 million, the company said.  </p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable December 16, to shareholders of record December 4, the company said.</p>
<p>Area Bancshares also said it declared a $0.03 a share cash dividend payable January 2 to shareholders of record December 18.</p>
<p>The dividend represents a split adjusted increase of $0.005 a share over the prior quarterly dividend of $0.04.</p>
</text>
